        </tr>
        <tr>
          <th scope="row">Size and ratio</th>
          <td>500 to 10,000 pixels on the longest side, 1,000 or more for zoom; no ratio stated</td>
          <td>1:1 at 800 by 800, 12 of 18 and 14 of 18</td>
          <td>1:1 at an 800 by 800 floor, 6 of 6 and 9 of 10</td>
          <td>consensus / consensus</td>
        </tr>
